{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/protocols","wordCount":962,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"protocol-与结构化子类型\">Protocol 与结构化子类型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Python 的鸭子类型哲学——&quot;如果它走路像鸭子、叫声像鸭子，那它就是鸭子&quot;——在 PEP 544 中获得了正式的静态类型支持。<code>Protocol</code> 类定义了一组方法或属性签名，任何实现了这些签名的类都自动满足该协议，无需显式继承。这种机制称为<strong>结构化子类型</strong>（Structural Subtyping）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>Protocol</code> 把&quot;能做什么&quot;从&quot;是什么&quot;中解耦出来。它与 ABC 的根本差异在于匹配依据：ABC 要求被适配的类<strong>显式继承</strong>（名义子类型），而 Protocol 只看<strong>签名是否吻合</strong>（结构化子类型）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ABC</th>\n<th>Protocol</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匹配依据</td>\n<td>显式继承关系</td>\n<td>方法/属性签名匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改被适配类</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时检查</td>\n<td><code>isinstance</code> 直接可用</td>\n<td>需 <code>@runtime_checkable</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享默认实现</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>框架内部继承树</td>\n<td>第三方库适配、回调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>另外要区分两层检查：静态检查器会验证完整签名；而 <code>@runtime_checkable</code> 下的 <code>isinstance</code> 只检查方法名是否存在（基于 <code>hasattr</code>），不验证参数类型与返回值。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"名义子类型-vs-结构化子类型\">名义子类型 vs 结构化子类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>名义子类型（Nominal）</th>\n<th>结构化子类型（Structural）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判断依据</td>\n<td>显式继承关系</td>\n<td>方法和属性签名匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型语言</td>\n<td>Java、C#</td>\n<td>Go（interface）、TypeScript</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>ABC / 普通继承</td>\n<td>Protocol</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优势</td>\n<td>类型关系明确</td>\n<td>灵活、无耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>劣势</td>\n<td>需要修改被适配类</td>\n<td>类型错误信息可能不直观</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"定义与使用-protocol\">定义与使用 Protocol</h2><h3 id=\"基本定义\">基本定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Protocol, runtime_checkable&#10;&#10;class Drawable(Protocol):&#10;    def draw(self, x: int, y: int) -&gt; None: ...&#10;&#10;class Circle:&#10;    def draw(self, x: int, y: int) -&gt; None:&#10;        print(f&quot;Circle at ({x}, {y})&quot;)&#10;&#10;class Square:&#10;    def draw(self, x: int, y: int) -&gt; None:&#10;        print(f&quot;Square at ({x}, {y})&quot;)&#10;&#10;def render(shape: Drawable) -&gt; None:&#10;    shape.draw(10, 20)&#10;&#10;render(Circle())&#10;render(Square())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Protocol, runtime_checkable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Drawable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Circle at (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Square at (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(shape: Drawable) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shape.draw(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">render(Circle())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">render(Square())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Circle 和 Square 无需继承 Drawable，只要实现了 <code>draw</code> 方法即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"属性协议\">属性协议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Sized(Protocol):&#10;    @property&#10;    def size(self) -&gt; int: ...&#10;&#10;class MyList:&#10;    @property&#10;    def size(self) -&gt; int:&#10;        return 42&#10;&#10;def check(obj: Sized) -&gt; int:&#10;    return obj.size\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Sized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj: Sized) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.size</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"runtime_checkable\">runtime_checkable</h2><p>默认情况下，Protocol 仅供静态检查使用。添加 <code>@runtime_checkable</code> 装饰器后，可在运行时用 <code>isinstance</code> 检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@runtime_checkable&#10;class Closeable(Protocol):&#10;    def close(self) -&gt; None: ...&#10;&#10;class Connection:&#10;    def close(self) -&gt; None:&#10;        print(&quot;closed&quot;)&#10;&#10;print(isinstance(Connection(), Closeable))  # True\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@runtime_checkable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Closeable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Connection(), Closeable))  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># True</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"运行时检查的局限\">运行时检查的局限</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>支持</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检查方法是否存在</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>基于 <code>hasattr</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查方法签名</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>不验证参数类型和返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查属性类型</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>仅检查属性名是否存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查泛型参数</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>泛型在运行时被擦除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内置协议模式\">内置协议模式</h2><p>Python 标准库的许多&quot;魔法方法&quot;本质上就是隐式协议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>魔法方法</th>\n<th>typing 中的 Protocol</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可迭代</td>\n<td><code>__iter__</code>, <code>__next__</code></td>\n<td><code>Iterable</code>, <code>Iterator</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可哈希</td>\n<td><code>__hash__</code>, <code>__eq__</code></td>\n<td><code>Hashable</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文管理</td>\n<td><code>__enter__</code>, <code>__exit__</code></td>\n<td><code>contextlib.AbstractContextManager</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可比较</td>\n<td><code>__lt__</code>, <code>__le__</code> 等</td>\n<td><code>SupportsLessThan</code>（自定义）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可调用</td>\n<td><code>__call__</code></td>\n<td><code>Callable</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自定义复合协议\">自定义复合协议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Protocol, Iterator&#10;&#10;class Repository(Protocol):&#10;    def get(self, id: str) -&gt; dict: ...&#10;    def save(self, entity: dict) -&gt; None: ...&#10;    def list_all(self) -&gt; Iterator[dict]: ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Protocol, Iterator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, entity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> list_all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> Iterator[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"protocol-与-abc-的对比\">Protocol 与 ABC 的对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph ABC&#10;    A1[定义抽象基类] --&gt; A2[子类显式继承]&#10;    A2 --&gt; A3[强制实现抽象方法]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph Protocol&#10;    P1[定义协议签名] --&gt; P2[任意类实现签名]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P3[静态检查自动匹配]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph ABC\n    A1[定义抽象基类] --&gt; A2[子类显式继承]\n    A2 --&gt; A3[强制实现抽象方法]\n  end\n  subgraph Protocol\n    P1[定义协议签名] --&gt; P2[任意类实现签名]\n    P2 --&gt; P3[静态检查自动匹配]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>框架内部层次继承</td>\n<td>ABC</td>\n<td>需要共享实现、约束继承树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方库适配</td>\n<td>Protocol</td>\n<td>无法修改第三方类的继承关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回调 / 策略模式</td>\n<td>Protocol</td>\n<td>只关心&quot;能做什么&quot;而非&quot;是什么&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要运行时注册</td>\n<td>ABC</td>\n<td><code>register()</code> 支持虚拟子类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型-protocol\">泛型 Protocol</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Protocol, TypeVar&#10;&#10;T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)&#10;&#10;class Comparable(Protocol):&#10;    def __lt__(self, other: &quot;Comparable&quot;) -&gt; bool: ...&#10;&#10;class Stack(Protocol[T]):&#10;    def push(self, item: T) -&gt; None: ...&#10;    def pop(self) -&gt; T: ...&#10;    def peek(self) -&gt; T: ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Protocol, TypeVar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Comparable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __lt__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Comparable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Protocol[T]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, item: T) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> T: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> peek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> T: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>泛型 Protocol 可以参数化协议中的类型，使其适用于多种数据类型的容器或算法。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>优先使用 Protocol 而非 ABC 来定义接口，除非需要共享默认实现</li>\n<li>为 Protocol 起描述行为的名称（如 <code>Drawable</code>、<code>Serializable</code>）而非名词</li>\n<li>保持 Protocol 精简——每个协议只描述一组紧密相关的方法</li>\n<li>谨慎使用 <code>@runtime_checkable</code>，它无法验证方法签名的正确性</li>\n<li>在团队项目中将核心 Protocol 集中定义在 <code>protocols.py</code> 或 <code>interfaces.py</code> 中</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Protocol（PEP 544）把鸭子类型提升为静态可检查的结构化子类型：只要签名匹配即满足协议，无需显式继承。</li>\n<li>与 ABC 的分工：需要共享实现、约束继承树时用 ABC；适配无法修改的第三方类、表达回调与策略时用 Protocol。</li>\n<li><code>@runtime_checkable</code> 让 Protocol 可用于 <code>isinstance</code>，但只检查方法名是否存在，不验证签名与泛型。</li>\n<li>Python 的诸多魔法方法（<code>__iter__</code>、<code>__enter__</code>、<code>__call__</code>）本质上就是内置协议。</li>\n<li>泛型 Protocol 可参数化容器与算法，配合 <code>TypeVar</code> 表达类型约束。</li>\n<li>命名上描述行为（<code>Drawable</code>、<code>Serializable</code>），保持每个协议精简、职责单一。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","id":"protocol-与结构化子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"名义子类型 vs 结构化子类型","id":"名义子类型-vs-结构化子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"定义与使用 Protocol","id":"定义与使用-protocol"},{"level":3,"text":"基本定义","id":"基本定义"},{"level":3,"text":"属性协议","id":"属性协议"},{"level":2,"text":"runtime_checkable","id":"runtime_checkable"},{"level":3,"text":"运行时检查的局限","id":"运行时检查的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"内置协议模式","id":"内置协议模式"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义复合协议","id":"自定义复合协议"},{"level":2,"text":"Protocol 与 ABC 的对比","id":"protocol-与-abc-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型 Protocol","id":"泛型-protocol"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型标注与 typing 模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/type-annotations"},"next":{"title":"泛型与 TypeVar","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/generics"}}